    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1709" root="بتر" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاتِرٌ</span></b>  A <i>cutting,</i> or <i>sharp,</i> sword; (T, S, M, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَتَّارٌ</span></b>  (T, M, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَتُورٌ</span></b>  (M) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَتَارٌ</span></b> .
(K.) [But all of these except the first are app.
intensive epithets, signifying <i>very sharp.</i>] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُبَاتِرٌ</span>.

